WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.029
(swooshing)

00:00:02.029 --> 00:00:02.910
- [Jughead voiceover]
The summer before your

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:04.490
junior year in high school,

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:05.568
and how do you spend it?

00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:07.281
♪ Silence is deafening ♪

00:00:07.281 --> 00:00:10.140
♪ In storms still stuck in the clouds ♪

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:11.320
Maybe you spent it on trial

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.312
for a murder you didn't commit.

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:15.828
- [Old Man] You impressed me
today, you've been tapped.

00:00:15.828 --> 00:00:17.278
♪ My eyes up to give love ♪

00:00:17.278 --> 00:00:18.930
♪ Hit the sound ♪

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.980
- [Jughead] You're breaking
Archie out of Juvie?

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.130
- [Archie] Your dad is still out there,

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.180
as long as we're together,

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.950
I don't think I can go back to Riverdale.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:25.950
- If you loved me,

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.098
you would come home.

00:00:27.098 --> 00:00:29.793
♪ The rain starts pouring down ♪

00:00:29.793 --> 00:00:30.840
- [Jughead voiceover]
What returned to Riverdale

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.130
was something far different from

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.682
the redheaded boy next door.

00:00:33.682 --> 00:00:36.324
♪ The greatest show in town ♪

00:00:36.324 --> 00:00:38.800
- So, what did I miss?

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:39.633
- Well.

00:00:39.633 --> 00:00:42.092
♪ Welcome to the end of the world ♪

00:00:42.092 --> 00:00:42.925
- My God.

00:00:42.925 --> 00:00:45.069
♪ The end of the world ♪

00:00:45.069 --> 00:00:46.620
- [Hermoine] Dilton Doiley and Ben Button

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.590
were found in the woods with blue lips.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.410
- Griffins and Gargoyles.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:51.990
- We thought it was just
a game, but it's not.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.623
He's real, the Gargoyle King.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:58.020
- This game is literally killing people.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:00.010
- So my dad played G&amp;G in high school.

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:01.500
- [Betty] All of our parents did.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.240
- They're in danger, our
children, it's happening again.

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:05.073
- Where'd you get this?

00:01:05.073 --> 00:01:05.906
- It was in my locker,

00:01:05.906 --> 00:01:06.826
same with everyone else.

00:01:06.826 --> 00:01:07.946
♪ Come to the flames ♪

00:01:07.946 --> 00:01:11.190
♪ Feels so good when they lick your skin ♪

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.060
- [Jughead Jones] All of its connected.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:13.400
They make drugs inside the prison,

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.176
which all the kids take
when they play G&amp;G.

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:17.630
(thud)
- Here's your drug money.

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:19.410
- You're Jughead's mom.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.830
- We got the whole town JB.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:22.850
- I could feel it
(clinking)

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:24.721
- Everything's going
just how you said mom.

00:01:24.721 --> 00:01:27.740
- One more thing, don't tell
Jughead about our business.

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:29.770
- You broke the code, turn
in your jackets and go.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.498
- I'm a Serpent by blood, you
can't take that away from me.

00:01:32.498 --> 00:01:34.647
♪ Come one come all to the greatest show ♪

00:01:34.647 --> 00:01:36.000
- [Cheryl] What's this?

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.040
- [Toni] The Pretty Poisons.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.290
- [Cheryl] And you're the leader?

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:40.344
- Can I kiss you?

00:01:40.344 --> 00:01:41.177
- Archie...

00:01:41.177 --> 00:01:43.370
♪ Welcome to the end of the world ♪

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:45.960
- Mom, you're actually
buying this farm crap.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:47.323
Some huckster's is selling you.

00:01:47.323 --> 00:01:49.658
- The farm gave me back my brother.

00:01:49.658 --> 00:01:51.101
♪ Welcome to the end of the world ♪

00:01:51.101 --> 00:01:52.140
- There's a refrigerator filled

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:54.600
to the brim with human organs.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.130
- [Charles] It's vital
that we find your mom,

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:58.323
in fact I'm Charles, your brother.

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:02.460
- The true master behind
the Gargoyle King,

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.520
was you Penelope.

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:07.640
- My revenge on a town, that's
a hideous and cruel place.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.020
Now it's time to play one final round.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:11.853
Begin!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:13.533
- [Betty] Dad?

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:15.200
- You either shoot me or I'll shoot you.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:16.421
- [Penelope] Enough!

00:02:16.421 --> 00:02:18.671
(cracking)

00:02:19.754 --> 00:02:22.054
♪ Welcome to the end of the world. ♪

00:02:22.054 --> 00:02:24.150
- [Jughead voiceover]
Riverdale belonged to us again.

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:24.983
- Oh yeah!

00:02:24.983 --> 00:02:26.660
- [Jughead voiceover] The
future was ours to write,

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.610
but what would our stories be?

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.440
- I'm gonna stay in Riverdale
while your dad's away.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:33.123
- Son, I will always love you.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:38.260
- Guys, we've got senior year
ahead of us, let's enjoy it.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.820
- Friends forever?

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:40.653
- Sure!

00:02:40.653 --> 00:02:41.486
Let's toast.

00:02:41.486 --> 00:02:42.319
- To the future.

00:02:42.319 --> 00:02:43.152
(clinging)

00:02:43.152 --> 00:02:44.587
(hawk screaming)

00:02:44.587 --> 00:02:47.310
(crackling)

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.820
- We have to burn all of our clothes,

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:50.930
including Jughead's beanie.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.770
We never speak of this,

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.740
ever.

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:54.573
Do it!

00:02:55.714 --> 00:02:59.964
♪ Welcome to the end of the world ♪

